flowchart TB
  Internet --> CF[Cloudflare DNS/WAF/CDN/Turnstile]
  CF --> GLB[GCP External HTTPS LB + origin policy]
  GLB --> API[Cloud Run: api]
  GLB --> RT[Cloud Run: realtime]
  API --> VPC[VPC/private connectivity]
  RT --> VPC
  VPC --> SQL[(Cloud SQL PostgreSQL 18 + PostGIS HA)]
  VPC --> VAL[(Memorystore Valkey HA)]
  API --> PUB[Pub/Sub]
  API --> TASKS[Cloud Tasks]
  PUB --> WORK[Cloud Run workers]
  TASKS --> WORK
  WORK --> SQL
  WORK --> VAL
  API --> GCS[Cloud Storage]
  WORK --> GCS
  API --> SM[Secret Manager / KMS]
  WORK --> SM
  API --> BQ[BigQuery]
  API --> PH[PostHog analytics/experiments]
  API --> OBS[OTel / Sentry]
  GH[GitHub Actions + WIF] --> AR[Artifact Registry]
  AR --> API
  AR --> RT
  AR --> WORK
  EAS[Expo EAS Build/Submit/Update] --> STORES[Apple App Store / Google Play]
  STORES --> MOBILE[Mobile clients]
  EAS -. compatible OTA .-> MOBILE
  MOBILE --> CF

  Note1[DB connection budget:\nAPI pool default 8/instance;\nrealtime/worker lower;\nmax instances constrained by DB headroom]
  API --- Note1

  Note2[OperationalFlags/ClientPolicies:\nPostgreSQL authoritative,\nValkey cached, Admin audited;\nindependent from PostHog]
  SQL --- Note2
